            "review_title": "Review at ICHIBAN Japanese Hotpot Buffet",
            "review_text": "Hoàng Kim H\n1 contribution\n0\nGreat Food with Great Service\nApr 2017 • Friends\nAll of the taste of seafood, beef, pork... is very fresh and delicious. I like all types of food here, from sushi to salad, and there are so many vegetable for the hotpot, too. Free water and coke. The staffs are very friendly and always fill food on the bar for customer to enjoy. The decoration is in Japanese style and the space is very wide. I'll go here next time with my family and friends.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 11, 2017\nO4362OVlinas\nThank you for choosing Ichiban Hotpot and your nice review for our restaurant.\nWritten April 13, 2017\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
